4. Maid compatibility (nested mod)
----------------------------------

    maid-compat/  —  mod id "scg2_maid_compat", "Scorched Guns: Maid Compat"
    Author:   ELMO_SYG (author of this port)
    Origin:   ported from a Minecraft 1.20.1 addon of the same name, recompiled against this port

It is built and shipped as a nested jar inside scguns-0.5.5.jar (META-INF/jarjar/). It stays inactive
unless Touhou Little Maid is installed.

5. Dependencies — NOT redistributed in this repository
------------------------------------------------------

The jars in libs/, maid-compat/libs/ and libs-compile/ belong to their respective authors and are
deliberately excluded from version control. To build this port you must obtain them yourself; see
libs/README.md. Required at runtime:

    Framework           MrCrayfish        license: see its own project
    GeckoLib            GeckoLib team     license: see its own project (MIT at the time of writing)
    Curios API          TheIllusiveC4     license: see its own project (LGPL-3.0 at the time of writing)

Optional integrations, used only when the player has them installed:

    Just Enough Items, Create, Create: New Age, Create Ore Excavation, Create Aeronautics,
    Immersive Engineering, Mekanism, Sable, Prometheus, Soul Fire'd, Cobweb, Farmer's Delight

Every one of them keeps its own license and its own authors; this mod merely talks to them through
public APIs and skips the integration when they are absent.

